  "description": "This 2 bedroom apartment is offered furnished and equipped and is located in the heart of Subiaco. The apartment and furnishings are in excellent condition, located on the top floor with a balcony.<br/><br/>Features include:<br/>- Open plan lounge/dining with reverse cycle air conditioner and sliding to door outside to balcony.<br/>- Kitchen - electric stove top and oven, ample cupboard space, fridge and microwave.<br/>- Perfect breakfast bar area with stools and room for friends to sit and chat while you are cooking up a storm.<br/>- Dishwasher<br/>- European Laundry with washer and dryer.<br/>- Bathroom features good size shower recess and vanity unit and all neutral tiles throughout to add your own touch.<br/>- Electric hot water system.<br/>- Reverse cycle air conditioner in lounge room.<br/>- Master bedroom is a good size room with double mirrored wardrobe and has a queen size bed ensemble.<br/>- Second bedroom is also a generous size room with 2 x single bed ensembles and wardrobe with mirror door, can be converted to fit a queen size bed.<br/>- One Car Bay<br/><br/>Furniture included:<br/>- Fridge<br/>- Microwave<br/>- Bar stools<br/>- Lounge suite<br/>- Dining table<br/>- TV unit with TV and DVD player<br/>- Queen bed ensemble<br/>- 2x single beds<br/>- Washing machine<br/>- Dryer<br/><br/>Complex facilities include:<br/>- Swimming pool<br/>- Spa<br/>- BBQ area<br/><br/>This fully furnished apartment is located on the top floor in a<br/>well maintained complex with a sparkling pool, spa and BBQ area for your enjoyment. Walk to restaurants, shops, bars and cafes. One car bay provided.<br/><br/>*Sorry no pets allowed due to strata by laws<br/><br/>PLEASE NOTE - THERE WILL BE NO APPLICATIONS ACCEPTED PRIOR TO THE VIEWING and YOU MUST VIEW THE PROPERTY TO OBTAIN THE QR CODE and APPLY CODE to get the link for the application.<br/><br/>For more information, please contact Susan Taylor at susan.taylor@centroestates.com.au",
